    "This changed": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esto ha cambiado"}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t confirm it. It may have arrived: try again and it won’t be done twice.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no lo confirmó. Puede que llegara: vuelve a intentarlo y no se hará dos veces."}}}},
    "Your Mac’s data was reset, so this answer no longer applies.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los datos de tu Mac se reiniciaron, así que esta respuesta ya no aplica."}}}},
    "Your Mac already had this answer.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac ya tenía esta respuesta."}}}},
    "Alondra couldn’t save this answer on this device.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no pudo guardar esta respuesta en este dispositivo."}}}},
    "Your Mac couldn’t do it. Nothing changed; try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no pudo hacerlo. No cambió nada; inténtalo de nuevo."}}}},
    "This device is no longer approved. Approve it again from the Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este dispositivo ya no está aprobado. Vuelve a aprobarlo desde el Mac."}}}},
    "This changed while you were looking. It’s updated now; try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esto cambió mientras lo mirabas. Ya está actualizado; vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "Couldn’t reach your Mac. Nothing was sent; try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo contactar con tu Mac. No se envió nada; inténtalo de nuevo."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t answer. It may be off, or Alondra may not be running on it. Try again in a moment.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no respondió. Puede estar apagado o Alondra puede no estar en marcha. Vuelve a intentarlo en un momento."}}}},
    "Couldn’t reach Alondra. Check your connection and try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo conectar con Alondra. Revisa tu conexión y vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t answer in time. Trying again…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no respondió a tiempo. Reintentando…"}}}},
    "The connection to the Alondra server dropped. Trying again…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Se cortó la conexión con el servidor de Alondra. Reintentando…"}}}},
    "The Alondra server is busy. Trying again…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El servidor de Alondra está saturado. Reintentando…"}}}},
    "Couldn’t load this from your Mac. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo cargar desde tu Mac. Vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "saved data · connection lost": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "datos guardados · sin conexión"}}}},
    "Add a note or line comment": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Añade una nota o un comentario en una línea"}}}},
    "Choose a valid time.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Elige una hora válida."}}}},
    "Could not verify the latest diff; review was not sent: %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo comprobar el último diff; la revisión no se envió: %@"}}}},
    "It started, and what is left of it waits for PR #%@ of “%@” to be merged: it goes on once that PR is merged.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Empezó, y lo que queda espera a que se fusione el PR #%1$@ de «%2$@»: sigue en cuanto ese PR se fusione."}}}},
    "Send your comments or clear them before accepting.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Envía tus comentarios o bórralos antes de aceptar."}}}},
    "The PR changed; review the new diff before sending": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El PR ha cambiado; revisa el nuevo diff antes de enviar"}}}},
    "The diff changed; refresh before sending line comments": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El diff ha cambiado; actualiza antes de enviar comentarios en líneas"}}}},
    "The document changed. Review it again before sending comments.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El documento ha cambiado. Revísalo de nuevo antes de enviar comentarios."}}}},
    "This PR is no longer open": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este PR ya no está abierto"}}}},
    "This diff is too large to verify; review was not sent": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este diff es demasiado grande para comprobarlo; la revisión no se envió"}}}},
    "We couldn’t confirm the request. Your draft is kept; sending it again won’t create it twice.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No pudimos confirmar la petición. Tu borrador se conserva; enviarla de nuevo no la creará dos veces."}}}},
    "We couldn’t confirm the result. Sending it again won’t apply it twice.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No pudimos confirmar el resultado. Enviarlo de nuevo no lo aplicará dos veces."}}}},
    "We couldn’t confirm the result. Try again; it won’t be applied twice.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No pudimos confirmar el resultado. Inténtalo de nuevo; no se aplicará dos veces."}}}},
    "We couldn’t confirm the result. Your draft is kept; sending it again won’t apply it twice.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No pudimos confirmar el resultado. Tu borrador se conserva; enviarlo de nuevo no lo aplicará dos veces."}}}},
